{
  "key": 19942,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_KojiHello",
      "en_US": [
        "Koji: I’m from Cianwood, in\n",
        "Johto. Chuck trained me himself…\r",
        "mostly by throwing me into the\n",
        "sea.\r",
        "He says when I can beat him\n",
        "without shouting, the Gym is\r",
        "mine. I’m working on the quiet\n",
        "part."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarenHello",
      "en_US": [
        "Maren: I grew up on a boat\n",
        "between Slateport and Lilycove.\r",
        "Hoenn is mostly ocean, you know.\r",
        "Pacifidlog has never had a Gym.\n",
        "I want to be its first Leader!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_ReneHello",
      "en_US": [
        "Rene: Bonjour! I’m from Laverre\n",
        "City, in Kalos. Valerie taught\r",
        "me that a battle can be\n",
        "beautiful.\r",
        "I want a Gym where Fairy types\n",
        "are taken seriously.\r",
        "Underestimate them at your\n",
        "peril."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_Student1",
      "en_US": [
        "I came all the way from Sinnoh\n",
        "for Yarrow’s lecture. I took\r",
        "notes on everything. Everything!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketTMsA",
      "en_US": [
        "TMs! Fighting, Poison, Ground,\n",
        "Flying, Bug and Rock moves!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_gText_PleaseComeAgain",
      "en_US": "Please come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketTMsB",
      "en_US": [
        "Fire, Water, Grass, Electric and\n",
        "Ice TMs! What’ll it be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketTMsC",
      "en_US": [
        "Psychic, Ghost, Dragon, Dark,\n",
        "Steel and Fairy TMs!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketCeladon",
      "en_US": [
        "Celadon Dept. Store TMs, right\n",
        "here at the Academy!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketHeld",
      "en_US": [
        "Held items for serious battlers.\n",
        "Choose wisely!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketHerbs",
      "en_US": [
        "Herbs, orbs, weather rocks and\n",
        "berries. Have a look!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketNature",
      "en_US": [
        "Mints, Bottle Caps and Ability\n",
        "items. Change anything!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MarketTraining",
      "en_US": [
        "Vitamins, power items and Ev\n",
        "berries. Train it right!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_HallSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Leader Academy · Main Hall The\n",
        "library, and lecture halls A to\r",
        "D."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MastersBoard",
      "en_US": [
        "Type Masters’ Board: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} has\n",
        "passed {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} of the 19 trials."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_BattleSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Battle Hall Rental battles. Win\n",
        "streaks pay BP."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_Statue",
      "en_US": [
        "A statue of Roserade, the\n",
        "Academy’s emblem.\r",
        "The plaque reads: “Grace.\n",
        "Thorns. Victory.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_Welcome1",
      "en_US": [
        "Wisteria: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}. And\n",
        "you must be {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "Welcome to the Leader Academy. I\n",
        "am Wisteria, its Headmaster.\r",
        "Our candidates come from every\n",
        "region, all chasing the same\r",
        "dream you are: a Gym of their\n",
        "own.\r",
        "My type masters have been\n",
        "sending me reports on you.\r",
        "Good ones."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_Welcome2",
      "en_US": [
        "The main hall, just ahead, is\n",
        "our library. Its lecture halls\r",
        "are where our Instructors teach:\n",
        "each has a lesson in tournament\r",
        "strategy… and a demonstration\n",
        "battle.\r",
        "In the Battle Hall, you can\n",
        "battle with rental teams. Every\r",
        "win pays Battle Points, or BP."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_Welcome3",
      "en_US": [
        "Spend BP at our Market, behind\n",
        "the fence to the west: TMs, held\r",
        "items, Mints, and the like.\r",
        "But know this: BP is never the\n",
        "only way! Every cart there takes\r",
        "ordinary money, too. Just tell\n",
        "the cashier at the gate how\r",
        "you’ll pay."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_Welcome4",
      "en_US": [
        "The other candidates love a\n",
        "practice battle. Challenge them\r",
        "as often as you like. They pay\n",
        "BP as well.\r",
        "And there’s a Pokémon Center, of\n",
        "course. Make yourself at home,\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_MentorBye",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: That’s my cue.\n",
        "Learn everything you can here,\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "The next time we battle, I want\n",
        "to be surprised!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_CandidateAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} ({STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0},\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}): A practice battle,\r",
        "for BP?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_CandidateHealed",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Pokémon were patched up\n",
        "after the practice match."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_CandidateLater",
      "en_US": "Anytime. I’ll be here."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_gGymChallengeWinText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_Academy_Text_EarnedBP",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} earned {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} BP!\n",
        "(Total: {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} BP)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0955_CV_CANVAS_LEADER_ACADEMY_cv_unported",
